{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hant",
  "language_raw": "Trad_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Trad_Chinese/script/t09.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Trad_Chinese/script/t09.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "t09_01",
      "hash64": "809C074CFB302532",
      "text": "歡迎來到焙固鎮。\\n這裡是星星與陶瓷器的城鎮。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "t09_02",
      "hash64": "809C064CFB30237F",
      "text": "我的家族代代都是陶器工匠唷！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "t09_03",
      "hash64": "809C054CFB3021CC",
      "text": "水量好少……\\c\\n如果水像水炮一樣噴出來，\\n那該有多好玩呀。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "t09_05",
      "hash64": "809C034CFB301E66",
      "text": "好大的盤子～！\\n這是幾人份的三明治呢～？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "t09_06",
      "hash64": "809C024CFB301CB3",
      "text": "焙固鎮的餐具在帕底亞\\n也是非常受歡迎的工藝品喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "t09_07",
      "hash64": "809C014CFB301B00",
      "text": "陶器是從土窯誕生的！\\c\\n把成形的黏土放進窯裡，\\n花上好幾天慢慢燒結而成。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "t09_19",
      "hash64": "80990B4CFB2DF627",
      "text": "這個城鎮的對戰場，\\n過去是作為天文台建造而成的喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "t09_23",
      "hash64": "80A3154CFB365BAA",
      "text": "爬上前方的那條坡道之後，\\n可以看到像茶一樣的寶可夢喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "t09_24",
      "hash64": "80A3104CFB36532B",
      "text": "到焙固鎮的一路上，\\n是不是把[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳給折騰壞了？\\c\\n不過只要來過１次，\\n下次就能搭飛翔計程車來了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "t09_30",
      "hash64": "809F8E4CFB33406E",
      "text": "焙固鎮的交通很不方便！\\n摩托蜥是不可或缺的好夥伴。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "t09_40",
      "hash64": "808E904CFB24D0A1",
      "text": "我為了道館館主莉普來到這裡，\\n但是這裡的盤子也好可愛喔～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "t09_43",
      "hash64": "808E8D4CFB24CB88",
      "text": "在天文台上寶可夢的畫，\\n簡簡單單的很可愛吧。\\r\\n那個叫像素畫，對不對？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
